WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:33.090 --> 01:35.150
Welcome, both of you.

01:36.500 --> 01:37.520
I'm Mikumo.

01:37.930 --> 01:39.450
I wanted to meet you.

01:39.570 --> 01:42.260
To see what kind of guys you were.

01:43.040 --> 01:46.300
Now I understand the reason why the
president hasn't eliminated you guys.

01:46.570 --> 01:47.660
The reason?

01:47.810 --> 01:48.740
Yeah.

01:49.240 --> 01:50.500
Could we hear it?

01:50.980 --> 01:52.810
Well, don't rush.

01:53.710 --> 01:55.270
Naoto Kirihara...

01:56.080 --> 01:58.570
Now you know
what my power is, right?

01:59.020 --> 02:01.110
You can't win against me.

02:01.990 --> 02:05.450
But I will give you
a chance just this once.

02:05.890 --> 02:06.920
A chance?

02:07.730 --> 02:08.750
Yeah.

02:09.830 --> 02:11.230
<i>Funeral</i>

02:11.230 --> 02:15.100
<i>Funeral
Episode 21</i>

02:17.970 --> 02:19.370
What are you trying to do?

02:21.110 --> 02:25.600
Well, if you use a little bit
of power, you can kill me.

02:25.810 --> 02:27.210
Just a little bit.

02:27.710 --> 02:29.650
You just need to push my hand.

02:30.550 --> 02:32.180
Wouldn't that be easy for you?

02:32.590 --> 02:33.480
You...

02:33.890 --> 02:34.880
Brother!

02:35.050 --> 02:37.450
Come on, do it...

02:43.330 --> 02:44.300
Come on...

02:58.640 --> 03:00.170
Naoto Kirihara...

03:00.610 --> 03:04.240
You are frightened by
feeling pleasure in killing.

03:04.450 --> 03:06.150
That's why you are suffering.

03:07.950 --> 03:11.910
You just want to be the
good kid and pretend to suffer.

03:11.990 --> 03:13.320
I'm pretending?

03:13.390 --> 03:17.060
Brother, don't just accept
what this guy says!

03:17.830 --> 03:21.160
You can't do anything but stand there
and tell people what you feel, huh?

03:21.230 --> 03:21.820
What?

03:21.900 --> 03:22.960
Why you...

03:27.870 --> 03:29.070
That's right!

03:29.540 --> 03:30.630
It's you!

03:32.080 --> 03:35.170
It wasn't Miss Sakie.
It was you that did it!

03:35.610 --> 03:38.710
The one that killed the five high
school girls making it seem like suicide...

03:38.780 --> 03:40.080
It was you!

03:44.160 --> 03:45.520
That's right.

03:45.590 --> 03:46.650
Mikumo!

03:46.990 --> 03:48.720
Why did you do such
a horrible thing like that?

03:48.790 --> 03:50.850
To drive Sakie up the wall.

03:51.900 --> 03:55.920
The emotion of sadness will
make Sakie's powers bloom.

03:56.640 --> 03:58.570
Her power is wonderful.

03:59.210 --> 04:01.260
If we use that power as a catalyst...

04:01.340 --> 04:05.870
...then we can contaminate the
consciousness of countless people.

04:05.950 --> 04:07.240
Catalyst?

04:07.480 --> 04:10.470
Then, what will happen to
Miss Sakie's consciousness?

04:10.550 --> 04:11.780
It doesn't matter.

04:11.850 --> 04:15.220
We only need her power to act as a catalyst.

04:15.620 --> 04:16.710
That's horrible.

04:17.090 --> 04:20.220
For that, you sacrificed
Mr. Tsuzuki and those five?

04:20.760 --> 04:22.990
It was needed no matter what.

04:23.060 --> 04:24.360
No way...

04:25.000 --> 04:26.970
It's for Sakie's happiness.

04:27.030 --> 04:28.190
Happiness?

04:28.330 --> 04:32.500
Sakie will be able to live
happily if she is taken in by Ark.

04:32.570 --> 04:35.470
So you guys are going to
use her however you like?

04:35.540 --> 04:37.840
Don't confuse me
with someone like Mikuriya.

04:38.280 --> 04:43.720
I just amplify the desire inside
people's heads and materialize it.

04:44.280 --> 04:46.250
Like what you saw before.

04:46.690 --> 04:50.450
Stop acting like a good person
even though you're a murderer!

04:50.820 --> 04:52.650
We were murdered by you!

04:53.130 --> 04:55.290
We were killed with your powers!

04:55.360 --> 04:56.690
It's your fault!

05:00.770 --> 05:01.630
Brother!

05:01.770 --> 05:03.030
Get it together!

05:09.440 --> 05:11.570
Those five students that died...

05:11.640 --> 05:15.810
...were very frightened of the truth
that their existence had no value.

05:16.180 --> 05:19.910
I just pushed that feeling
a little and made it a little bigger.

05:27.090 --> 05:28.020
Naoto.

05:28.160 --> 05:31.960
That woman is going to fall in
love with you at first sight.

05:37.800 --> 05:38.790
Hey, make her stop!

05:40.610 --> 05:42.230
Solve it yourself.

05:45.980 --> 05:48.450
Stop! You are being manipulated!

05:48.980 --> 05:49.950
Stop!

05:58.520 --> 06:02.890
Who do you think did
something to hurt her, you or me?

06:03.060 --> 06:04.030
What?

06:04.600 --> 06:05.960
Now you know, right?

06:06.170 --> 06:08.960
You guys can't do anything for Sakie.

06:09.100 --> 06:10.630
So don't do anything.

06:11.200 --> 06:13.830
If you think you don't
want to hurt anyone...

06:13.910 --> 06:15.740
...then it's better to do nothing.

06:16.010 --> 06:17.810
You just stay out of the way.

06:17.910 --> 06:19.100
Understood?

06:40.000 --> 06:41.190
Thank you...

06:41.670 --> 06:45.600
We will take full
responsibility for Miss Sakie.

06:45.940 --> 06:47.840
Please take your time here.

06:48.170 --> 06:50.160
Their food is wonderful.

06:50.540 --> 06:51.940
Sakie...

06:52.180 --> 06:54.810
...always had a weak
body since she was little.

06:54.880 --> 06:56.850
Please, please...

06:57.820 --> 07:00.310
Mother, don't worry.

07:00.790 --> 07:03.850
Miss Sakie is a very
important guest of Ark.

07:04.160 --> 07:07.020
We wouldn't do anything to hurt her.

07:07.090 --> 07:08.990
Please take good care of her.

07:09.830 --> 07:12.160
When will you be
coming to pick up Sakie?

07:12.230 --> 07:13.390
Let's see...

07:13.500 --> 07:15.190
Earlier is better.

07:18.070 --> 07:21.010
We will come pick her up
in two or three days.

07:21.310 --> 07:22.300
See you.

08:56.340 --> 08:57.360
Brother...

08:58.400 --> 08:59.600
Are you okay?

09:00.110 --> 09:02.300
It seemed like you
were suffering a lot.

09:03.110 --> 09:03.900
Yeah...

09:04.410 --> 09:05.770
Seems like I was dreaming...

09:06.480 --> 09:08.210
Brother, tonight is the night.

09:08.880 --> 09:12.110
Tonight, they are going to
take Miss Sakie to Ark.

09:14.290 --> 09:15.620
Her little sister is crying.

09:16.220 --> 09:19.160
She's crying saying she doesn't
want to be separated from her sister.

09:19.460 --> 09:20.360
I...

09:21.060 --> 09:22.720
What are you saying I should do?

09:23.300 --> 09:24.260
Brother!

09:24.400 --> 09:26.830
We can't let Miss Sakie
fall into Ark's hands!

09:26.900 --> 09:28.060
We can't!

09:51.060 --> 09:51.920
What's the matter?

09:52.460 --> 09:54.690
Don't take Miss Sakie away!

09:55.160 --> 09:58.600
Don't stick your nose into affairs
that have nothing to do with you.

09:58.900 --> 10:01.920
This is a matter between
her parents and myself.

10:02.300 --> 10:04.860
You guys don't have
the right to say anything.

10:04.940 --> 10:06.530
I'm telling you to stop!

10:06.610 --> 10:10.230
I heard from Mikumo
that you guys talked it over.

10:16.220 --> 10:17.240
Miss Sakie...

10:17.320 --> 10:19.780
Please, don't take my sister away!

10:19.850 --> 10:21.220
Tomomi, stop it!

10:21.290 --> 10:22.250
But!

10:24.090 --> 10:26.420
This is our family's problem!

10:26.590 --> 10:28.180
Please don't stick your nose in!

10:28.260 --> 10:31.060
It's wrong to hand over
Miss Sakie to them!

10:31.630 --> 10:33.560
Then what am I supposed to do?

10:33.700 --> 10:36.790
Sakie sent five girls
to commit suicide!

10:36.870 --> 10:40.240
I can't keep her in my house anymore.

10:43.010 --> 10:44.940
She hasn't killed anyone!

10:45.110 --> 10:46.440
It wasn't Miss Sakie!

10:46.650 --> 10:48.200
Stop trying to calm me down!

10:48.350 --> 10:51.410
Please get out of the way.

10:54.190 --> 10:55.380
I already told you.

10:55.820 --> 10:57.950
I nullify supernatural powers.

10:58.020 --> 11:00.860
No, you can't take Miss Sakie!

11:01.990 --> 11:03.690
Miss Sakie, wake up!

11:03.760 --> 11:04.520
Run!

11:04.600 --> 11:06.120
If you don't hurry and run...

11:09.170 --> 11:10.130
Let... go...

11:10.600 --> 11:14.300
If you have something
you want to say, contact Ark.

11:15.640 --> 11:16.470
Naoya!

11:19.310 --> 11:20.300
Are you okay?

11:20.610 --> 11:21.580
Sis!

11:27.020 --> 11:28.110
Stop it, Tomomi!

11:32.290 --> 11:33.050
Sis!

11:40.100 --> 11:41.220
Brother...

11:59.420 --> 12:00.820
Are you up?

12:06.120 --> 12:06.990
Who are you?

12:11.430 --> 12:13.020
I'm Akiko Okuhara.

12:14.870 --> 12:16.990
There are reasons for suffering.

12:17.540 --> 12:21.230
Suffering is eventually
transformed into enormous power.

12:21.640 --> 12:26.130
That's why there is a reason for
the suffering that you were given.

12:26.710 --> 12:32.740
Why do you live with
these mysterious powers...

12:32.820 --> 12:35.180
I will tell you why.

12:40.390 --> 12:44.590
You have a massive power
that will save the world.

12:45.460 --> 12:46.930
Massive power?

12:47.230 --> 12:48.290
Yes...

13:02.710 --> 13:06.050
Sakie hasn't fully awakened yet.

13:06.350 --> 13:09.050
If you mean Tsuzuki's video, I have it here.

13:09.960 --> 13:11.420
Not Tsuzuki.

13:11.490 --> 13:15.620
With him, it's not going to be
a big enough shock to awaken Sakie.

13:15.990 --> 13:19.620
You predicted that Tsuzuki
was going to betray us...

13:19.700 --> 13:24.000
...and fall in love with Sakie.

13:24.270 --> 13:27.400
Also the fact that Mikumo was
going to reduce Tsuzuki to his current state...

13:27.470 --> 13:30.570
...and that Sakie was
going to be shocked by this happening.

13:30.940 --> 13:32.840
That's why you sent
Tsuzuki to the school.

13:35.580 --> 13:37.670
I guess I'm a fool...

13:37.850 --> 13:40.550
...compared to a major predictor.

13:40.750 --> 13:42.910
We need a definite way.

13:43.620 --> 13:47.820
We need to awaken Sakie
or else it's destruction.

13:48.730 --> 13:50.700
With Naoto and Naoya too...

13:52.200 --> 13:54.690
I guess we have to end it here.

13:55.200 --> 13:56.360
I understand.

13:56.870 --> 13:58.100
Watch out.

13:58.600 --> 14:01.540
In my predictions, those two are uncertain data.

14:01.670 --> 14:04.400
If those two are involved,
the future is chaos.

14:05.040 --> 14:07.070
That still hasn't changed.

14:08.410 --> 14:09.810
Please don't worry.

14:10.180 --> 14:12.910
Since it's Mikumo,
he'll most likely do it well.

14:25.830 --> 14:29.130
Mikumo's goal is to
make you hesitate.

14:29.500 --> 14:31.400
I'm mortified. I can't do anything.

14:32.340 --> 14:34.740
I know I can't hesitate, but...

14:35.370 --> 14:38.310
I can't make your
hesitation disappear.

14:40.480 --> 14:42.470
Maybe they're right.

14:42.950 --> 14:43.810
What?

14:43.980 --> 14:46.080
As long as Sakie has that power...

14:46.150 --> 14:48.050
...she'll never be able
to lead a normal life.

14:48.490 --> 14:50.150
Just like how we used to be.

14:50.460 --> 14:53.690
Miss Sakie is only a tool to them.

14:54.730 --> 14:59.130
Am I to fight them
and get Sakie back?

14:59.530 --> 15:02.830
But where are we
supposed to bring her after that?

15:03.570 --> 15:06.160
What do we do so that
Sakie can live in happiness?

15:07.610 --> 15:11.130
Miss Sakie can't be
separated from her little sister.

15:33.600 --> 15:34.290
Damn it.

15:34.370 --> 15:37.060
Brother, no! That's not real!

15:56.150 --> 15:57.550
A-Are you okay?

15:57.620 --> 15:58.680
Y-Yeah...

15:58.860 --> 16:01.450
Damn it. This is Mikumo's doing...

16:01.930 --> 16:02.790
Where are you!

16:02.890 --> 16:04.830
Where are you, Mikumo!

16:07.970 --> 16:08.830
Hold up!

16:08.930 --> 16:09.870
B-Brother!

16:14.640 --> 16:15.830
Hold up, Mikumo!

16:45.170 --> 16:47.070
Fake heroism, huh?

16:47.140 --> 16:48.040
What did you say?

16:48.110 --> 16:51.170
Don't make me laugh, you murderer.

16:51.810 --> 16:53.940
You are the same kind as me.

16:54.110 --> 16:55.880
You and I are not the same!

16:55.950 --> 16:58.750
How can you say that
when you killed three of them?

16:59.380 --> 17:02.180
You are just trying
to deceive yourself.

17:02.750 --> 17:05.120
Why don't you put
a knife to your neck again?

17:05.290 --> 17:06.450
Just like the other day.

17:06.520 --> 17:07.890
I can't do that.

17:08.260 --> 17:12.220
Because you are about to be
awakened by the pleasures of murder.

17:12.500 --> 17:14.190
I am different from you!

17:14.800 --> 17:16.990
You just need to obey me.

17:17.270 --> 17:19.330
We don't need to fight.

17:22.540 --> 17:24.240
You can't win against me.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.140
Just quit.

17:36.690 --> 17:39.350
Brother! Just what's gotten into you?

17:40.130 --> 17:41.390
Naoto...

17:42.160 --> 17:43.390
I'm over here.

17:50.340 --> 17:51.670
Over here...

17:53.240 --> 17:55.870
Stop, Brother! There's no one there!

17:55.940 --> 17:56.800
It's a trap!

17:56.880 --> 17:58.900
You can't see him? Let go!

18:18.230 --> 18:19.160
Brother...

18:25.440 --> 18:26.460
How was it?

18:26.540 --> 18:29.770
When you threw your power
at full force, it felt good, right?

18:30.510 --> 18:32.200
You want to break them!

18:32.540 --> 18:34.910
Everything with that power...

18:35.080 --> 18:36.210
Why you!

18:36.680 --> 18:39.670
That's right, Naoto, kill me!

18:44.960 --> 18:46.550
You held back.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.760
Why do you hesitate?

18:49.990 --> 18:51.790
Are you scared, Naoto?

18:51.860 --> 18:52.590
Damn it!

18:52.660 --> 18:53.820
Brother, stop! Brother!

18:54.130 --> 18:55.060
I'm going to kill him!

18:55.130 --> 18:56.120
Brother!

19:19.890 --> 19:20.860
I did it.

19:21.490 --> 19:22.890
I defeated Mikumo.

19:23.500 --> 19:25.860
Naoya, I got Mikumo.

19:32.400 --> 19:33.300
Naoya...

19:33.970 --> 19:35.100
Hey, Naoya!

19:35.210 --> 19:36.700
Naoya! Naoya!

19:39.810 --> 19:40.800
Naoya!

19:45.220 --> 19:46.840
You are a killer.

19:47.250 --> 19:50.240
Naoto, you are a murderer!

20:44.340 --> 20:45.170
Brother!

20:55.190 --> 20:57.250
Brother, come back! Brother!

20:57.360 --> 20:59.020
Naoto is dead.

20:59.720 --> 21:02.350
Now you are alone, Naoya.

21:02.790 --> 21:03.990
How pitiful...

21:06.730 --> 21:07.790
What's wrong?

21:08.430 --> 21:11.370
You don't feel anger
toward me, Naoya?

21:11.840 --> 21:13.900
The pitiful one is you.

21:14.310 --> 21:15.200
What?

21:15.740 --> 21:18.970
You are the more pitiful
one for not being able to...

21:19.040 --> 21:22.140
...prove you're alive
in any other way but this.

21:23.280 --> 21:24.580
You've got to be kidding.

21:25.150 --> 21:27.380
Brother! I beg you,
please come back!

21:27.450 --> 21:28.940
Brother! Brother!

21:29.150 --> 21:30.210
Brother!

21:42.170 --> 21:43.360
What's wrong?

21:45.500 --> 21:47.060
The fog cleared.

21:50.140 --> 21:52.800
The one spot of the future vision...

21:52.880 --> 21:56.280
...that had a thick fog
over it has cleared just now.

21:58.620 --> 21:59.580
Sakie...

21:59.820 --> 22:00.810
Yes?

22:04.720 --> 22:08.850
Right now, I am able
to bring you good news.

22:11.160 --> 22:13.560
What is the good news?

22:31.250 --> 22:34.510
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.590 --> 22:37.180
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.260 --> 22:41.850
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.930 --> 22:45.160
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.230 --> 22:47.860
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.270
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.710 --> 23:03.980
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.050 --> 23:10.680
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.760 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.290 --> 23:18.850
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.930 --> 23:24.200
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.270 --> 23:29.730
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.810 --> 23:34.610
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:40.140
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.220 --> 23:45.490
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.560 --> 23:51.020
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.100 --> 23:58.190
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:02.710 --> 24:06.700
The light that falls upon myself
fell to the shallows called paradise.

24:08.050 --> 24:11.310
That is a light no one can win against.

24:13.920 --> 24:17.550
When the dim light
changes to the great hope...

24:19.320 --> 24:22.020
...the door of fate will be opened.

24:23.430 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 22, "Judgement by God"</i>

24:26.330 --> 24:28.830
Where are we headed?
